\par }{\i\fs28\lang1033\cgrid0 A}{\fs28\lang1033\cgrid0 . Both phrases may be rendered "the wine of the Elves". However, the genitive phrase }{\b\fs28\lang1033\cgrid0 i limp\'eb Eldaron}{\fs28\lang1033\cgrid0 
