\par }{\i\fs28\lang3081\cgrid0 B}{\fs28\lang3081\cgrid0 . I saw that the man's arm was broken.
\par }{\i\fs28\lang3081\cgrid0 C}{\fs28\lang3081\cgrid0 . The king was mighty, but the queen was wiser than the king.
