\par }{\i\fs28\lang3081\cgrid0 F}{\fs28\lang3081\cgrid0 . Don't drink, for [there] is poison in your cup!
\par }{\i\fs28\lang3081\cgrid0 G}{\fs28\lang3081\cgrid0 . Were you here on the tenth day when they came? 
